  ]
}



07. The goals that went out - three, all to A2: batch update, merge, create; none to A1, none for Robot 9 or the refused create
==============================================================================================================================
sends goal 2 to action 'A2'
goal 2 on 'A2' (urn:goal:2) ended, state 4
sends goal 5 to action 'A2'
goal 5 on 'A2' (urn:goal:5) ended, state 4
sends goal 7 to action 'A2'
goal 7 on 'A2' (urn:goal:7) ended, state 4

